    "rsv_0283": "Ghost button",
    "rsv_0284": "Give students, freelancers, and teachers — in Pakistan and around the world — professional-quality tools that respect them. Free forever for the basics, private by design, and available in 10 languages so more people can use them comfortably.",
    "rsv_0285": "Go to tools",
    "rsv_0287": "Government forms, exam portals and job applications commonly cap photos at 50KB, 100KB or 200KB. A phone photo is 3–8 MB — 20–80× too large — so this isn't a small trim, it's a real conversion job.",
    "rsv_0288": "Hard — bots ~65 WPM",
    "rsv_0290": "Hear the code",
    "rsv_0291": "Help articles for the chatbot.",
    "rsv_0293": "Hit an exact file size for forms and portals — 50KB, 100KB, 200KB or your own target.",
    "rsv_0294": "Home Row Basics",
    "rsv_0296": "How certificates work.",
    "rsv_0297": "How it will work",
    "rsv_0298": "How lessons, tests and progress work.",
    "rsv_0299": "How manual deposits work",
    "rsv_0300": "How many words can you type in 60 seconds? Race the clock and beat your best.",
    "rsv_0261": "Feature",
    "rsv_0262": "Fighter Profile",
    "rsv_0263": "Flags",
    "rsv_0264": "For photographs, JPEG or WebP. WebP is typically 25–35% smaller than JPEG at the same quality. PNG is lossless, so it can't be squeezed the same way — for a strict KB target, WebP is usually the answer.",
    "rsv_0265": "Forms and portals reject oversized photos. Here's how to hit an exact KB target without ruining quality.",
    "rsv_0266": "Forms and portals reject oversized photos. Hit an exact KB target without ruining quality.",
    "rsv_0268": "Fraud",
